# The Island mode accepts the caster's own Island and rejects a Mountain (CR 115.1a, 400.3).
[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mountain
Active Volcano
Mountain x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Active Volcano.Cast
Bot1.Modes(Return target Island to its owner's hand)
! Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Island)
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
? Bot1.Mana =

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Island; Mountain; Mountain; Mountain; Mountain; Mountain
Bot1.Battlefield = Mountain
